e2e/security-audit.spec.ts:1:P2-inverted-assertion:Pattern 2 (inverted assertion): assertion passes when the thing being tested is broken — a future engineer 'fixing' this test will silently elide the signal. Restate positively + use expected-fail at the workflow level. Or pair with a negative-control test that stages the violation.
