e2e/demo-login.spec.ts:1:P8-demo-bypass:Pattern 8 (demo-spec bypass): a demo-claiming or uaks-declared spec must use only what a user at a keyboard could do — no state injection, no network mocks, no API-direct user actions. Move the shortcut to a lower-fidelity spec (and name the helper STUB_/INJECT_/BYPASS_), or drop the demo claim. See practices/test-fidelity.md.
